HIPAA Journal reports an update to the Unlimited Technology Systems breach that occurred between October 10 &#8211; 15, 2025, and was discovered on October 19, 2025: On July 23, 2026, the HIPAA Journal reported on a data breach at Unlimited Technology Systems, a Montgomery, Ohio-based provider of revenue cycle management services. At the time, the...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/08/07/unlimited-technology-systems-data-breach-affects-3-8-million-patients/">Source</a></p>

