KTUL in Oklahoma reports: The City of Coweta says they are currently responding to a ransomware attack. According to officials, on Werdnesday, August 5, the City experienced at system-wide attack and immediately contacted their contracted IT provider and additional cycbersecurity professionals to secure their systems to prevent any further intrusion and to begin a recovery...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/08/07/city-of-coweta-hit-with-system-wide-ransomware-attack-has-backup/">Source</a></p>

